<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:21px;">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Hi {{name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;">We received a request to reset the password for your {{appName}} account.</p>
{{> button url=resetUrl label="Choose a new password"}}
<p style="margin:20px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748b;">This link expires in {{expiresIn}} and can be used once. If you did not request a reset, no action is needed and your password stays unchanged.</p>
